; FBX 7.5.0 project file
; A triangle skinned to bones A (root) and Far (child of A). Far was bound 1000 m out on X
; and saved 5 mm further out. Clip "Move" animates only A, so while it plays Far holds its
; saved position. The 5 mm difference is well within float precision at 1000 m and must not
; be mistaken for the bind pose because the bone is far from the origin.

